Please find the Q3 2025 inspection status for the ATU-100. Per QSCP-IP-ATU100 Rev 4, we are monitoring several lines with active nonconformances. Regarding QSCP-NCR-2024-031, the 6-month re-measurement of 4-RA-101 detailed in LNDE-RPT-20250811-029-R0 confirms the corrosion rate remains within the FFS assumption; this line is scheduled for replacement during the August 2026 turnaround.

Additionally, we are tracking QSCP-NCR-2024-032 for 2-RF-102, where four CMLs are below t-min. As per the updated plan, 2-RF-102 is due for re-measurement in November 2025.

